        ('Alex Williams', 'alexander@zestmortgagebrokers.co.uk', 'Zest Mortgage Brokers', 'Mortgage and Protection Broker', 'Mortgage and Protection Broker', '', 'https://www.zestmortgagebrokers.co.uk/', 'I started working in the financial sector in 2017, joining the Bank of Ireland UK, being simultaneously responsible for the AA and Post Office financial products. With a unique perspective from 9 years in the Army Reserves, I approach every situation with a positive can-do attitude. Consistently excelling at customer service and with a flexible approach I endeavour to make any customer journey as stress-free as possible', 'Highbridge', 'Ireland', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07891 830924/ 077704 72908 · Location: Highbridge · Country: Ireland'),
        ('Alex Woodward', 'alexwoodward.leeds@gmail.com', 'Alex Woodward Copywriter', 'Content Strategist', 'Content Strategist', '', 'https://www.alex-woodward.co.uk/', 'I’m a content strategist, content designer and copywriter, partnering with businesses, charities and agencies on projects where words matter. Since 2017, I’ve planned, written and refined content for clients across many sectors, from financial services and technology to healthcare and the arts. Some are big-name brands, others are ambitious scale-ups. I’m an approved supplier for a global charity and a regular collaborator with creative and digital agencies in Brighton, London and beyond. Before becoming a freelance wordsmith, I held leadership roles in digital marketing, earned a Master''s in sociolinguistics and had my research published. I bring editorial judgement, strategic insight and a curious mind to each brief. I only produce content that is original and genuinely useful.', 'Brighton', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07582 424861 · Location: Brighton · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Alexa Noble', 'alexa@smart-finances.co.uk', 'Smart Finances', 'Founder', 'Founder', '', 'https://www.smart-finances.co.uk/', 'I have won the Public Speaking Award at the 2020 Successful Women Awards for my work representing Smart Finances. Operating out of the Bournemouth and Poole area, her company provides local financial and business networking services. She is an active member of professional business networks in the Dorset area, including B2B Networking', 'Bournemouth', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07908 180180 · Location: Bournemouth · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Alexander Koveleski', 'alexander.koveleski@quoin.uk', 'Quoin', 'Co-founder', 'Co-founder', '', '', 'Most decisions that matter don''t come with obvious answers. There are usually multiple credible paths. Each can be justified. And the financial implications of each — when properly modelled — look quite different from what the headline numbers suggest. That gap between the numbers and the decision is where I work. I''m a strategic financial consultant based in Edinburgh, working with ambitious businesses globally — primarily at the scale-up stage, and at pivotal moments: growth decisions, M&A, raising investment, and situations that don''t fit neatly into a standard framework.', 'Edinburgh', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07984 715781 · Location: Edinburgh · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Alexis Gaillard', 'alexgaillard@outlook.fr', 'Digitrone Group', 'Entrepreneur', 'Entrepreneur', '', '', 'My entrepreneurial journey has entailed: Building and scaling businesses. Experiencing the thrill of selling successful ventures. Learning invaluable lessons the hard way.', 'Edinburgh', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07784 625978 · Location: Edinburgh · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Alice Manuel', 'alice.manuel@thriveprogramme.org', 'Thrive Coach', 'Owner', 'Owner', '', 'https://www.thriveprogramme.org/alice-manuel/', 'I discovered the power of The Thrive Programme after my son had struggled with anxiety and Emetophobia for years. We had tried everyone and everything with only small temporary gains. I used to be a Primary Teacher for many years but retrained as a Thrive Coach because I wanted to enable other people to have the opportunity to change their lives in the way it had transformed his, that of my family and the lives of tens of thousands of clients all over the world. That was many years ago now and it was the best decision I''ve ever made. I love the fact that it empowers people; the way it makes change so predictable and accessible; and that it leaves clients with skills which last a lifetime.', '', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 077859 81492 · Country: United Kingdom'),
