        ('Alison Bagley', 'alibags04@live.co.uk', 'AliBagleyCoaching', 'Business Writers Coach and Best Selling Author', 'Business Writers Coach and Best Selling Author', '', 'https://alibagleycoaching.co.uk/', 'everything I do is about writing. Yes I constantly have ideas and try new things but at the heart of it, writing, either mine or yours. I am a multi award winning writer, a best selling author and now, back to my bid management/writing roots in my core business as Bid Lead for Kindridge Bid Solutions, supporting your business in winning work as you tender for public and private sector contracts. So, I help other authors to write and publish their books, I write and manage work winning business proposals and I write my own books. Mainly business help books such as: There''s a Beach of Gold, Just Around the Corner - everything you need to know about bidding for contracts and developing your own bid submissions. IT''s OUT NOW!', 'Lichfield', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 0776 3610892 · Location: Lichfield · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Alison Greene', 'info@virtualali.co.uk', 'Virtual Ali', 'Pet Sitter', 'Pet Sitter', '', 'https://www.virtuali.uk/', 'Caring for your home and pets while you’re away is both our responsibility and our pleasure. We know how important it is for your pets to remain in the comfort of their own home, cared for by someone who offers the same love and attention you would if you were there. This familiar environment is priceless for their wellbeing. We follow their usual routines — from feeding times and walks to playtime and rest — and can also administer medication if and when needed. By keeping everything consistent, we help reduce any anxiety your pets may feel, ensuring they stay happy and settled while you enjoy your well-earned break. You also have complete peace of mind knowing your home is secure while we are their, parcels taken in, your bins are put out and any unwanted visitors don''t think the…', 'Shrewsbury', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07791 585242 · Location: Shrewsbury · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Alison Petty', 'alison@alisonpetty.com', 'Alison Petty', 'Life Coach and Business Mentor', 'Life Coach and Business Mentor', '', 'https://alisonpetty.com/', 'My life’s purpose is to enable YOU to figure out and dismantle whatever negative narrative or limiting belief is holding you back so that you can go forth, create and live your very own life’s purpose. The one you so very much DESIRE and DESERVE. And I achieve all of this through powerful coaching conversations and the application of NLP (Neuro-Linguistic Programming) and IEMT techniques. My unique coaching process will enable you to find the answers for yourself. It is an empowering approach that will bestow you with a strong sense of achievement and deep realisation that YOU hold the power within yourself to create dynamic positive change within your career and personal life. With compassion, care and humour, I will guide and support you along every step of your journey and ensure…', '', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07812 074375 · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Allan Brown', 'allanbrown74@hotmail.com', 'Allan Brown Real Estate', '', '', '', 'https://www.kwuk.com/agent/keller-williams-evolve-10/', 'With over twenty years as a casino manager on five-star cruise lines, I''ve honed skills in high-end service and client relations. For the past six years, I''ve run my own estate agency, specializing in luxury properties. Now, I''m partnering with Vela Club in La Manga, Spain-a premier concierge firm for elite real estate in Spain, the Balearics, and UAE. We also offer private jet charters, luxury yacht sales, supercar rentals, and more. Passionate about delivering unmatched experiences.', 'Glasgow', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07456 976002 · Location: Glasgow · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Allan Freeman', 'allan.freeman@agfrecruitment.co.uk', 'AGF Recruitment', 'Commercial Finance Recruite', 'Commercial Finance Recruite', '', 'https://agfrecruitment.co.uk/', 'I help CFOs and Finance Directors solve the commercial problems that sit between the numbers and the decisions. Whether it’s unreliable forecasting, weak commercial insight, margin pressure, underperforming revenue, inefficient reporting or a Finance team struggling to influence the wider business, that’s where I add value. I know the Commercial Finance talent who can make a genuine difference to the business. They’re the people who understand what’s driving performance, challenge assumptions, influence stakeholders and turn financial insight into commercial action.', 'Farnham', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07734 915712 · Location: Farnham · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Allen Ruddock', 'allen@linkedbusiness.co.uk', 'Linked Business', 'Founder', 'Founder', 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/allenruddock', '', 'Many small business owners don’t struggle because they lack ambition. They struggle because growth creates complexity. Leads arrive in different places. Follow-up becomes inconsistent. Marketing feels reactive. Client communication gets fragmented. And the business slowly becomes harder to manage. I know that feeling because I’ve lived it myself across multiple businesses over the last 20+ years. That experience is exactly why I created Business Hub Central.', 'Guildford', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 0776 8463833 · Location: Guildford · Country: United Kingdom'),
