        ('Amanda Hagen', 'amanda_hagan@icloud.com', 'The Resilient Entrepreneur', 'Self-employed', 'Self-employed', '', '', 'You don’t need more coping strategies. You need the pattern to shift. I work with high-functioning professionals who are tired of holding it all together while quietly managing fear, trauma, performance anxiety or emotional overload. Outwardly capable. Inwardly carrying more than they let on. As an Emotional Reset Specialist, I work at the level of emotional patterning and nervous system response — not just surface symptoms. We identify what still triggers a reaction. We process what hasn’t settled. We reset the default pattern.', 'Stratford-Upon-Avon', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07803 502867 · Location: Stratford-Upon-Avon · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Amanda Riley', 'amandar@theartofhealing.org.uk', 'The Art of Healing', 'Owner', 'Owner', '', 'https://artofhealing.org.uk/', 'I am the ART of Healing creator, initially my business was Amanda Riley Therapies, which expanded into the “ART” of Healing. I came to the therapy world after having moved away from the city working life and wanting more. My father dying of cancer sent me on a path of self discovery and illness, diagnosed with Ulcerative Colitis in 2007. In all the journey of this experience I have learnt depths of emotions and discovered therapies and therapists that have supported me. Armed with this wealth of knowledge I am now ready to share with you.', 'Haslemere', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 0798 9604750 · Location: Haslemere · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Amelia-Kate Murfitt', 'amelia@ameliakateva.co.uk', 'Business Bees - workflow management', 'Founder', 'Founder', '', '', 'Helping growing owner-led businesses run more smoothly without everything relying on the owner. I work alongside business owners to look at what’s happening behind the scenes. The processes, systems and day-to-day operations that can become messy as a business grows. Sometimes you know exactly what the problem is. Sometimes you just know something isn’t working as well as it should. I can parachute in to look at a particular problem or work alongside you for longer to help get the business behind your business working properly.', '', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07939 111583 · Country: United Kingdom'),
