        ('Andrew Guile', 'andyguile@askandyguile.co.uk', 'Ask Andy Guile', 'Business Coach and Trainer', 'Business Coach and Trainer', '', 'https://askandyguile.newzenler.com/', 'As the go to business coach for small business owners I’ve helped small business owners, entrepreneurs, and professionals cut through the noise, build confidence, and create simple, practical strategies that actually work in the real world. My approach is fun, straight‑talking, and refreshingly honest. No jargon. No fluff. No corporate waffle. Just clarity, confidence, and action. Alongside my coaching work, I also run a successful Utility Warehouse business , built on the basis of I only want you as a customer if I can save you money. I only want you as a partner if your ready to build an amazing extra income stream for life I use my coaching skills to support people who want to earn an extra income and join my UW team, earning extra, learning transferable skills and meeting like…', 'Runcorn', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07960 888001 · Location: Runcorn · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Andrew Hatcher', 'andrew@thecobraclub.co.uk', 'Cobra Clubs', 'Business Development Consultant', 'Business Development Consultant', '', '', 'I help UK businesses streamline sales, sharpen marketing, and install simple, scalable systems that turn growth plans into results. Tile Energy Ltd (Renewables) I’m currently working with Tile Energy Ltd, a UK solar specialist installing smart PV and battery solutions for homes and businesses, including SolarEdge and Tesla Powerwall systems. In a dual role as Sales Surveyor and Business Development Consultant, I generate new business across multiple channels while working with their team to enhance Zoho CRM and sales operations—improving lead capture, scheduling, follow-up, and reporting so we can serve customers faster and more professionally.', 'Royal Wootton Bassett', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Location: Royal Wootton Bassett · Country: United Kingdom'),
