        ('Andrew Struthers', 'andrew@startachat.co.uk', 'Startachat', 'CEO', 'CEO', '', 'https://startachat.co.uk/', 'I help businesses increase revenue by installing AI-driven systems that improve how they respond, decide, and follow up — without increasing advertising spend. Rather than offering growth partnerships or advisory services, my focus is on building and deploying AgentSync, a Unified AI Core that sits at the centre of a business and coordinates communication, decision-making, and execution across all channels and systems. My background began in engineering, where precision, systems thinking, and reliability mattered. That mindset carried into entrepreneurship, where I built and scaled multiple technology-led businesses by focusing on process, automation, and intelligent client acquisition rather than brute-force marketing.', 'Fort William', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07894 553145 · Location: Fort William · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Andy Brackenbury', 'andrew@keeptrustplanning.com', 'Keep Trust Planning', 'Managing Director', 'Managing Director', '', 'https://www.keeptrustplanning.com/', 'I am genuinely committed to providing exceptional customer care to each and every one of my clients. High levels of customer care may be simple to deliver, but too many get it wrong. By always “doing the right thing”, my clients can rely on my honesty and integrity. There are two very different aspects to my business. . Firstly, I assist small businesses to understand where their business is performing well and where it may need improvement, from their customers’ viewpoint. Our amazing team helps you take the guesswork out of delighting your customers. We design bespoke surveys, speak to your customers in a professional and friendly manner and we report the findings to you in an easy to understand manner. We don''t tell you, we work with you. Your expertise, knowledge of your customers…', 'Swindon', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07540 769077 · Location: Swindon · Country: United Kingdom'),
