        ('Andy Hopkinson', 'andy@fnsphotography.com', 'FNS Photography', 'Owner', 'Owner', '', 'https://fnsphotography.com/', 'I am a lover of light, a skilled photojournalist, visual storyteller, and I am passionate about your images. Whatever you do, make or sell, I bring out your passion in your business through arresting and scroll-stopping images and video. Event photography and video, interviews and testimonials, corporate storytelling, if your need is for something engaging and high quality but affordable, give me a call. Based in North Yorkshire we are ideally located for photography in Harrogate, Leeds, and York. I frequently work with clients from Skipton to Scarborough, Newcastle to Sheffield. Larger commissions often take me to London and UK wide. Overseas commissions by arrangement.', 'Boroughbridge', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07929 625984 · Location: Boroughbridge · Country: United Kingdom'),
