        ('Angela Daye', 'angela@innerpathways.co.uk', 'Inner Pathways', 'Kinesiologist, Hypnotherapist, Coach, Trainer', 'Kinesiologist, Hypnotherapist, Coach, Trainer', '', 'https://innerpathways.co.uk/', 'I hold a Master’s in I.T. from Stirling University and am passionate about far too many things – but that’s unlikely to be why you are here, so let me tell you the bit that probably is. I was a Health Kinesiology/Natural Bioenergetics client myself for almost a decade before I decided to train in it. My curiosity got the better of me. I started to wonder how it all worked, so I enrolled on level 1 just to satisfy my own fascination – and somehow never lost the fascination. These days, every new thing I learn just deepens that, and I get to watch it genuinely help people feel better. That never gets old.', '', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07803 082997 · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Angela Fumpston', 'afumpson@white-tiger.co.uk', 'White Tiger', '', '', '', 'https://angelafumpson.co.uk/', 'The white Tiger journey started in July 2013 with a strap line “Making Quality Count” , this was founded on the work with ISO9001 and QS9000. As a quality professional Angela understood that ISO 9001 needed a holistic approach, to ensure that it gave a competitive advantage, mitigated risk and supported growth. So she set out with a vision to turn the tables and be the person telling entrepreneurs the truth about the principles behind ISO 9001 and how to use it as part of sustainable company growth. To use quality management systems as an integral part of the business way of life not a bolt on as we see all too often these days.', '', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 0774 5482426 · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Angela Squires', 'angela@wordhound.co.uk', 'Wordhound Ltd', 'Director', 'Director', '', 'https://www.wordhound.co.uk/', 'You know your business inside out. The problem is getting everything that''s in your head out of your head and into your content. 👋 That''s where I come in. I have relaxed conversations with service-based business owners, ask useful questions, and listen for the good stuff – the stories, opinions and anecdotes. Then I use your own words wherever I can, so the content actually sounds like you. Then WordHound turns those conversations into content. That might mean: – website copy that sounds like you, because it''s full of the words you actually use – articles for your blog that are full of your expertise, without you having to write them – LinkedIn posts that aren''t the same as everyone else''s LinkedIn posts – short videos without scripts or the awkwardness of talking to a camera on your…', 'Combe Martin', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 0782 8458471 · Location: Combe Martin · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Angeline MacLaren', 'angeline.maclaren@sjpp.co.uk', 'Navigation Wealth Management', 'Financial Advisor', 'Financial Advisor', '', 'https://www.navigationwm.co.uk/', 'Having been in the financial industry with the same high street bank for 15 years Angeline made the decision to join Navigation Wealth Management in 2019. Head of Creative & Entertainment | Financial Adviser Helping Successful People Make Better Financial Decisions To Live The Life They Want | Planning Your Finances To Grow Real Wealth', 'Sheffield', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Phone: 07368 604980 · Location: Sheffield · Country: United Kingdom'),
        ('Anita Pickersgill', 'anita@thornburycollections.co.uk', 'Thornbury Collections', 'Credit Management, Processes, Effective Credit Control and Recoveries Manager', 'Credit Management, Processes, Effective Credit Control and Recoveries Manager', '', 'https://thornburycollections.co.uk/', 'I am an experienced Credit Control and Recoveries Manager and a Fellow of the Chartered Institute of Credit Management (FCICM). My work focuses on supporting businesses of all sizes by providing tailored solutions in dispute resolution, debt recovery, and credit control. I am dedicated to helping organisations enhance their financial processes through credit process reviews, policy implementation, and training to upskill teams. My expertise lies in debt recovery and litigation, ensuring seamless support that aligns with businesses'' growth plans.', 'Huddersfield', 'United Kingdom', 'A’s seed · Nov 2026 · Location: Huddersfield · Country: United Kingdom'),
